          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d22-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d22-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The following pages present Kestrel Aviation's Q4 2025 operating review. The period was characterised by steady demand and margin pressure from freight costs; management attention centred on charter operations and MRO fundamentals, cost discipline and platform reliability.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d22-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Reporting platform is owned by the Trust & Safety team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Yara Mansour, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 74.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d22-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Where a metric definition changed during the quarter, the prior quarter has been restated on the new basis.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 98.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d22-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 116.3
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d22-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 130.7
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
